<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-br">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Temporal Series | Observabilidade</title>
    <style>
      @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Zen+Dots&display=swap");

      :root {
        --bg: #08111f;
        --panel: #101b2b;
        --panel-strong: #142236;
        --line: rgba(151, 164, 184, .18);
        --muted: #91a0b8;
        --text: #f7fbff;
        --teal: #2dd4bf;
        --green: #22c55e;
        --amber: #f59e0b;
        --red: #ef4444;
        --blue: #60a5fa;
        --shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, .28);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        background:
          linear-gradient(rgba(96, 165, 250, .05) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(45, 212, 191, .045) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(140deg, #08111f 0%, #0c1728 52%, #101827 100%);
        background-size: auto, 34px 34px, auto;
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: Inter, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
      }

      .topbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 20;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 18px;
        min-height: 72px;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        background: rgba(8, 17, 31, .88);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        min-width: 0;
        color: var(--text);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--blue));
        color: #06111f;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .logo {
        font-family: "Zen Dots", Inter, sans-serif;
        font-size: 18px;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .subtitle {
        margin-top: 3px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        gap: 8px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .nav a,
      .ghost-btn,
      .primary-btn {
        min-height: 38px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: var(--text);
        cursor: pointer;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: background .18s ease, border-color .18s ease, color .18s ease, transform .18s ease;
      }

      .nav a,
      .ghost-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 0 13px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .04);
        border: 1px solid transparent;
      }

      .nav a:hover,
      .ghost-btn:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08);
        border-color: var(--line);
      }

      .nav .active {
        background: rgba(45, 212, 191, .12);
        border-color: rgba(45, 212, 191, .35);
        color: #bffaf2;
      }

      .primary-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 44px;
        padding: 0 18px;
        border: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--blue));
        color: #06111f;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .primary-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      .page {
        width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(360px, 520px);
        gap: 42px;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
        padding: 58px 0 42px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        min-height: 34px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        padding: 0 12px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(45, 212, 191, .35);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(45, 212, 191, .1);
        color: #bffaf2;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: .08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .status-dot {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--green);
        box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(34, 197, 94, .9);
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      p {
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        max-width: 720px;
        font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 72px);
        line-height: .98;
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }

      .hero h1 span {
        color: #a7f3d0;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        max-width: 640px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .metric-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 34px;
      }

      .metric-tile,
      .feature-card,
      .terminal-panel,
      .monitor {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20, 34, 54, .88), rgba(13, 24, 39, .88));
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .metric-tile {
        min-height: 96px;
        padding: 15px;
      }

      .metric-label {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 10px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .metric-value {
        margin-top: 12px;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .metric-value.teal {
        color: var(--teal);
      }

      .metric-value.green {
        color: var(--green);
      }

      .metric-value.amber {
        color: var(--amber);
      }

      .monitor {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        min-height: 520px;
        padding: 18px;
      }

      .monitor::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
          linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(45, 212, 191, .08), transparent),
          repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, .025), rgba(255, 255, 255, .025) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 5px);
        opacity: .75;
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .monitor-header,
      .monitor-grid,
      .chart-panel,
      .alert-line,
      .terminal-panel {
        position: relative;
      }

      .monitor-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .window-dots {
        display: flex;
        gap: 7px;
      }

      .window-dots span {
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--line);
      }

      .window-dots span:nth-child(1) {
        background: var(--red);
      }

      .window-dots span:nth-child(2) {
        background: var(--amber);
      }

      .window-dots span:nth-child(3) {
        background: var(--green);
      }

      .monitor-title {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: .08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .monitor-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .chart-panel {
        min-height: 150px;
        padding: 13px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(151, 164, 184, .14);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(5, 12, 23, .42);
      }

      .chart-panel.wide {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        min-height: 190px;
      }

      .chart-head {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .chart-value {
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .bars {
        display: grid;
        align-items: end;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
        gap: 5px;
        height: 86px;
      }

      .bars span {
        min-height: 12px;
        border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--teal), rgba(96, 165, 250, .55));
      }

      .line-chart {
        width: 100%;
        height: 126px;
      }

      .line-chart polyline {
        fill: none;
        stroke: var(--teal);
        stroke-width: 4;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
      }

      .line-chart .threshold {
        stroke: var(--amber);
        stroke-width: 2;
        stroke-dasharray: 7 7;
      }

      .alert-line {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 12px;
        padding: 12px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, .28);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(245, 158, 11, .08);
        color: #fde68a;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .terminal-panel {
        margin-top: 12px;
        padding: 14px;
        color: #bffaf2;
        font-family: Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .terminal-panel span {
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .section {
        padding: 28px 0 70px;
      }

      .section-head {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .section-head h2 {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
      }

      .section-head p {
        max-width: 520px;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .feature-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .feature-card {
        min-height: 184px;
        padding: 18px;
      }

      .feature-icon {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(45, 212, 191, .12);
        color: #bffaf2;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .feature-card h3 {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .feature-card p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      @media (max-width: 920px) {
        .topbar,
        .section-head {
          align-items: flex-start;
          flex-direction: column;
        }

        .nav {
          justify-content: flex-start;
        }

        .hero {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          min-height: auto;
        }

        .monitor {
          min-height: auto;
        }

        .feature-grid,
        .metric-row {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .page {
          width: min(100% - 28px, 1180px);
        }

        .hero {
          padding-top: 36px;
        }

        .monitor-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <div class="brand-mark">TS</div>
        <div>
          <div class="logo">Temporal Series</div>
          <div class="subtitle">Observabilidade e alertas</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Navegacao principal">
        <a class="active" href="/">Inicio</a>
        <a href="/login">Login</a>
        <a href="/register">Registro</a>
        <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="page">
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> Prometheus-ready monitoring</div>
          <h1>Series temporais com leitura <span>operacional</span>, nao decorativa.</h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">Acompanhe CPU, memoria, disco e rede em tempo real. Crie thresholds por metrica, visualize historico de alertas e navegue direto para o dashboard quando precisar agir.</p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="primary-btn" href="/register">Comecar agora</a>
            <a class="ghost-btn" href="/dashboard">Abrir dashboard</a>
          </div>

          <div class="metric-row" aria-label="Resumo de metricas">
            <div class="metric-tile">
              <div class="metric-label"><span>CPU</span><span>5m</span></div>
              <div class="metric-value teal">42%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-tile">
              <div class="metric-label"><span>RAM</span><span>live</span></div>
              <div class="metric-value green">68%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-tile">
              <div class="metric-label"><span>Alertas</span><span>ativo</span></div>
              <div class="metric-value amber">03</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="monitor" aria-label="Previa visual do dashboard">
          <div class="monitor-header">
            <div class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true">
              <span></span>
              <span></span>
              <span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="monitor-title">node-exporter / query_range</div>
          </div>

          <div class="monitor-grid">
            <div class="chart-panel wide">
              <div class="chart-head">
                <span>Uso de CPU (%)</span>
                <span class="chart-value">42.8</span>
              </div>
              <svg class="line-chart" viewBox="0 0 420 126" role="img" aria-label="Linha de uso de CPU">
                <line class="threshold" x1="0" y1="44" x2="420" y2="44"></line>
                <polyline points="0,90 34,84 68,92 102,70 136,76 170,52 204,66 238,40 272,58 306,32 340,48 374,34 420,46"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="chart-panel">
              <div class="chart-head">
                <span>Rede RX</span>
                <span>MB/s</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bars" aria-hidden="true">
                <span style="height:34%"></span>
                <span style="height:48%"></span>
                <span style="height:39%"></span>
                <span style="height:62%"></span>
                <span style="height:52%"></span>
                <span style="height:77%"></span>
                <span style="height:60%"></span>
                <span style="height:88%"></span>
                <span style="height:70%"></span>
                <span style="height:56%"></span>
                <span style="height:68%"></span>
                <span style="height:82%"></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="chart-panel">
              <div class="chart-head">
                <span>Disco</span>
                <span>status</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bars" aria-hidden="true">
                <span style="height:22%"></span>
                <span style="height:28%"></span>
                <span style="height:35%"></span>
                <span style="height:42%"></span>
                <span style="height:46%"></span>
                <span style="height:52%"></span>
                <span style="height:55%"></span>
                <span style="height:58%"></span>
                <span style="height:64%"></span>
                <span style="height:69%"></span>
                <span style="height:72%"></span>
                <span style="height:74%"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="alert-line">
            <strong>WARNING</strong>
            <span>CPU acima de 80% do threshold configurado</span>
          </div>

          <div class="terminal-panel">
            <div><span>$</span> query_range node_cpu_seconds_total</div>
            <div><span>&gt;</span> status OK | threshold sync | refresh 10s</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Feito para operar rapido.</h2>
          <p>Sem pagina de marketing perdida no caminho: cada entrada leva para uma acao util dentro do sistema.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">01</div>
            <h3>Dashboards vivos</h3>
            <p>Cards independentes por metrica, janelas de tempo por grafico e atualizacao automatica.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">02</div>
            <h3>Thresholds visiveis</h3>
            <p>Linhas de limite aparecem no grafico e a lista lateral mostra o status de cada alerta.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">03</div>
            <h3>Navegacao direta</h3>
            <p>Inicio, login, registro e dashboard usam a mesma linguagem visual e links consistentes.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
